0% 推广」，低转化渠道占比大幅提高，加权后被拉低。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="840.0" top="776.0" width="856.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="18" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" color="#B45309" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" maxLines="1">限制说明：不能由该数据证明因果</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="840.0" top="806.0" width="856.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" maxLines="1">该数据只有两期两渠道的访问数与成交数，没有渠道定义变化、投放调整、</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="840.0" top="832.0" width="856.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" maxLines="1">用户构成或外部因素信息，因此不能证明「构成变化导致总体下降」的因果，</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="840.0" top="858.0" width="856.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" maxLines="1">也不能证明任一渠道改善的原因。以上只是同一组数字的加权结构差异。</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="40.0" top="916.0" width="1520.0" height="52.0"><Container color="#F1F5F9" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #E2E8F0"/></Positioned><Positioned left="60.0" top="932.0" width="150.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" color="#64748B" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" maxLines="1">原始数据核对</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="220.0" top="924.0" width="180.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">前期·直接访问</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="220.0" top="944.0" width="180.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" color="#64748B" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">2,400 / 8,000 次</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="410.0" top="924.0" width="180.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">前期·推广访问</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="410.0" top="944.0" width="180.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" color="#64748B" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">200 / 2,000 次</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="600.0" top="924.0" width="180.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">后期·直接访问</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="600.0" top="944.0" width="180.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" color="#64748B" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">700 / 2,000 次</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="790.0" top="924.0" width="180.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">后期·推广访问</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="790.0" top="944.0" width="180.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="17" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" color="#64748B" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">960 / 8,000 次</Text></Container></Positioned></Stack></Container></Snapshot>